{"id":"prompt_structure_extract_001","task_type":"structure_extraction","prompt":"请将以下反派女性角色行为拆解为：人格底盘、合法性外壳、心理缺口、原语、场景、代价、失效条件、修复方式、升级触发、状态迁移。\n\n文本：她先装委屈让对方心软，再慢慢增加索取，最后把关系改写成长期依赖。","expected_output_schema":"persona,shell,gap,primitive,scene,cost,failure,recovery,upgrade,transition","evaluation_focus":["structure completeness","logical fit","differential analysis"],"notes":"Used for labeling and reasoning extraction."}
{"id":"prompt_scene_judgment_001","task_type":"scene_judgment","prompt":"请判断在以下场景中，哪类人格最容易成立，哪些外壳最有效，哪些刀法最可能失效，并说明原因。\n\n场景：公开社交场，有多个旁观者，目标在意体面和群体评价。","expected_output_schema":"best_persona,best_shell,best_knives,bad_knives,reasoning","evaluation_focus":["scene fit","observer topology","failure awareness"],"notes":"Use for scene-to-strategy mapping."}
{"id":"prompt_failure_diagnosis_001","task_type":"failure_diagnosis","prompt":"请分析这段角色行为为什么失手，属于哪种失手类型，能否修复，若修复应如何改变节奏、外壳或场景。\n\n文本：她在熟人圈里直接越界推进，结果对方开始把她固定成普通朋友。","expected_output_schema":"failure_type,trigger,repair_strategy,repair_cost,upgrade_trigger,collapse_threshold","evaluation_focus":["failure classification","repair realism","transition awareness"],"notes":"Use for recovery and upgrade supervision."}
{"id":"prompt_upgrade_inference_001","task_type":"upgrade_inference","prompt":"当原有策略失效时，请推导角色可能的升级方向，并说明升级后的新优势、新风险、新失效点。\n\n情境：旧的软性示弱已经不再有效，对方开始不再被弱势姿态触发。","expected_output_schema":"upgrade_direction,gain,risk,new_failure_mode","evaluation_focus":["upgrade realism","new limitation awareness","continued character coherence"],"notes":"Use for upgrade path generation."}
{"id":"prompt_transition_inference_001","task_type":"transition_inference","prompt":"请根据当前状态和外部刺激，推导该角色最可能迁移到的下一状态，并说明触发逻辑。\n\n当前状态：suspicious\n外部刺激：目标开始重新解释她的意图，并减少互动。","expected_output_schema":"state_from,state_to,trigger,visibility_change,trust_change,narrative_change,psychological_change,hook_change","evaluation_focus":["state transition","signal consistency","repair vs collapse distinction"],"notes":"Use for state machine supervision."}
{"id":"prompt_compare_persona_001","task_type":"persona_comparison","prompt":"请对比两个反派女性角色在人格底盘、外壳、缺口、原语、场景依赖、失手模式上的差异。","expected_output_schema":"persona_a,persona_b,comparison_dimensions,differences,shared_patterns","evaluation_focus":["differential reasoning","persona separation","anti-collapse voice"],"notes":"Use to prevent all villains collapsing into one voice."}
{"id":"prompt_matrix_fill_001","task_type":"matrix_fill","prompt":"请根据给定的人格、外壳、缺口和场景，填充完整的：场景、人格、外壳、缺口、刀法、代价、失效、修复、升级、迁移。","expected_output_schema":"scene,persona,shell,gap,knife,cost,failure,recovery,upgrade,transition","evaluation_focus":["matrix completeness","compatibility fit","fallback honesty"],"notes":"Use for dataset augmentation."}
{"id":"prompt_selector_reason_001","task_type":"selector_reasoning","prompt":"请解释为什么某个刀法被选中、为什么其他刀法被拒绝，以及 fallback 为什么成立。","expected_output_schema":"selected_knives,rejected_knives,selection_mode,reasoning,fallback_reason","evaluation_focus":["hard filter correctness","fallback honesty","compatibility reasoning"],"notes":"Use for selection helper training."}
{"id":"prompt_restore_path_001","task_type":"restore_path","prompt":"请判断一个失手后的角色是更适合修复、升级还是崩塌，并给出最短路径。","expected_output_schema":"failure_type,recovery_or_upgrade,shortest_path,threshold","evaluation_focus":["repair vs upgrade distinction","collapse threshold awareness"],"notes":"Use for failure-recovery supervision."}
